A name that resolves in none of the three discovery roots exits 1 with the name in the error and
nothing on stdout. The `known:` list spans the repository's shipped playbooks, so it is wildcarded.

-- cmd --
booping render-playbook fx-definitely-nonexistent
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: playbook not found: fx-definitely-nonexistent (known: [..])
